{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
    "name": "schedule_freight_pickup",
    "description": "Schedule a freight pickup. Provide the pickup time in UTC, an ISO 4217 currency code, the shipment weight in kilograms, depot coordinates, and an optional carrier note.",
    "strict": true,
    "parameters": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "pickup_iso_utc": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "UTC ISO 8601 timestamp ending in Z, for example 2026-04-15T13:30:00Z. The pattern checks the basic timestamp shape; the caller must ensure the date and time are valid.",
          "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}(\\.[0-9]+)?Z$"
        },
        "declared_currency": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Three-letter uppercase ISO 4217 currency code, for example USD. The pattern checks the shape, not whether the code is currently assigned.",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z]{3}$"
        },
        "weight_kg": {
          "type": "number",
          "description": "Shipment weight in kilograms; must be greater than zero.",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "depot_coordinates": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Latitude and longitude as lat,lon, with no whitespace and no space after the comma; for example 37.7749,-122.4194. Supply valid decimal coordinates within latitude and longitude ranges.",
          "pattern": "^-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?,-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$"
        },
        "carrier_note": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "Optional note for the carrier. Use null when no note is provided."
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "pickup_iso_utc",
        "declared_currency",
        "weight_kg",
        "depot_coordinates",
        "carrier_note"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  }
}
```

For strict function calling, every property must be listed in `required`; the optional note is therefore represented as nullable. Patterns enforce portable lexical checks, while descriptions cover semantic checks that patterns cannot reliably guarantee, such as valid calendar dates, assigned currency codes, and coordinate ranges.

{
  "type": "function",
  "name": "issue_prorated_credit",
  "description": "Issue a prorated credit for an unused billing period. Before calling, calculate all day counts using UTC calendar dates: the billing period starts inclusively and ends exclusively; the effective date is the first unused day. billing_period_days = billing_period_end minus billing_period_start in calendar days. billing_days_remaining = billing_period_end minus effective_date in calendar days, clamped to zero if the effective date is on or after the period end. Calculate credit_cents as paid_amount_cents × billing_days_remaining ÷ billing_period_days, rounded to the nearest integer cent with half-up rounding. Submit the calculated values and the source dates. Do not call if the dates or paid amount are missing, contradictory, or cannot be interpreted unambiguously.",
  "parameters": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "paid_amount_cents": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0,
        "description": "Amount paid for this billing period, in integer cents."
      },
      "billing_period_start": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "date",
        "description": "Inclusive start date of the billing period, in YYYY-MM-DD format."
      },
      "billing_period_end": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "date",
        "description": "Exclusive end date of the billing period, in YYYY-MM-DD format."
      },
      "effective_date": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "date",
        "description": "First unused day for which the credit applies, in YYYY-MM-DD format."
      },
      "billing_period_days": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 1,
        "description": "Calculated calendar-day count from billing_period_start to billing_period_end."
      },
      "billing_days_remaining": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0,
        "description": "Calculated unused calendar days from effective_date to billing_period_end, using the exclusive end date."
      },
      "credit_cents": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0,
        "description": "Calculated credit in integer cents: paid_amount_cents × billing_days_remaining ÷ billing_period_days, rounded to the nearest cent using half-up rounding."
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "paid_amount_cents",
      "billing_period_start",
      "billing_period_end",
      "effective_date",
      "billing_period_days",
      "billing_days_remaining",
      "credit_cents"
